# Google Drive API OAuth Credentials
# Obtain these credentials from Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Enable "Google Drive API"
# 3. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Application type: Desktop app)
# 4. Copy the Client ID and Client Secret into your local .env file

GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret_here
